      <title>BOJ’s Deputy Chief Flags AI’s Possible Impact on Neutral Rate</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-05/boj-s-deputy-chief-flags-ai-s-possible-impact-on-neutral-rate</link>
